# with the accepted governance/adr_20260712_iskra_constitution_v1_activation.md
# (also ADR-20260712-02). Left untouched to preserve the package's own integrity
# hashes; see governance/changelog.d for the disclosure note. A formal canonical
# proposal for Mythic Router must be re-issued under ADR-20260712-04 (next free slot).
!dist/SoT30_v5.4.1_Mythic_Corpus_Pass2_T76_Knowledge/
!dist/SoT30_v5.4.1_Mythic_Corpus_Pass2_T76_Knowledge/**
!dist/SoT30_v5.4.1_Mythic_Corpus_Pass2_T76_Knowledge.zip

